{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50510","headline":"五言夏日游神泉诗 · 贾言淑","name":"五言夏日游神泉诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"词人拥高节，狎异寻幽赏。\n𧯆险洞深涧，皦镜鲧无象\n形随澡魄员，气逐非烟上。\n徙谷萦新溜，分谿疏旧壤。\n冥功兆□□，効奇灵既往。\n共漱□□清，超然□□想。\n（见《金石萃编》卷六十一。\n〖此诗又见孙星衍《续古文苑》卷四，第五句作「形随随满魄鼎」；第九句所缺二字，下一字作「即」；第十一句缺二字之上一字，《金石萃编》存左半边，作「马」形，《续古文苑》作「鸣」。\n〗）（按是刻次韦元旦诗後，原署「主簿贾言淑」，书者体会爲尹元凯。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾言淑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50510.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50510","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}